    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What leaves RoleRace",
      "items": [
        "Groq receives only {targetRole, targetCountry, blocks, inventory} \u2014 built server-side from stored resumeData",
        "No DB credentials, storage keys, or profile fields; Groq never touches PostgreSQL",
        "Block text is marked untrusted data in the system prompt \u2014 not instructions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Advisory contract",
      "items": [
        "Schema is qualitative only \u2014 no scores, percentages, or ATS ratings exist in the contract",
        "findings[] need verbatim block quotes; absent content goes to gaps[]",
        "guidance explains strengthening \u2014 replacement/rewrite output is rejected by design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "No writes, no apply path",
      "items": [
        "Review is request/response \u2014 the only DB call is resumeVariant.findUnique",
        "Nothing writes to ResumeVariant, MasterCareerProfile, or PublicProfile",
        "No apply/rewrite/auto-fix path exists in the inspected code"
